<p>我们需要这个<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">AVAudioSessionRouteChangeReasonOldDeviceUnavailable</code> 判断是否是旧设备
通过<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">AVAudioSessionRouteChangePreviousRouteKey</code>拿出</p>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">AVAudioSessionRouteDescription</code>描述信息<br />
